    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>New regions are now available for Azure Cognitive Services.&nbsp;The&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fservices%2Fcognitive-services%2Fcontent-moderator%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cbhsandhu%40microsoft.com%7C9cc83f0713074b1d1b3d08d61875e111%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636723292074324845&amp;sdata=AakQTRgJ6%2FRHJ%2FITs9acCP9RyPzj2X9zncCiPkheN7w%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Content Moderator</a></u>,&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fservices%2Fcognitive-services%2Fcomputer-vision%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cbhsandhu%40microsoft.com%7C9cc83f0713074b1d1b3d08d61875e111%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636723292074334853&amp;sdata=wabUZ9J5q4AWRa%2B1U1Fb00sOnkm9XRCB7FTWNCFItqs%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Computer Vision</a></u>,&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/cognitive-services/face/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Face</a></u>,&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fservices%2Fcognitive-services%2Ftranslator-text-api%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cbhsandhu%40microsoft.com%7C9cc83f0713074b1d1b3d08d61875e111%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636723292074354866&amp;sdata=J4noRWRSqedi%2F7y5AyDqCGaKOHu%2BwfiOSoQk7mzSDPQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Translator Text</a></u>, and&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://na01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fservices%2Fcognitive-services%2Flanguage-understanding-intelligent-service%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cbhsandhu%40microsoft.com%7C9cc83f0713074b1d1b3d08d61875e111%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C636723292074354866&amp;sdata=kNd9%2FZQBpBS8lycHaDSSdxtkw2o4W6Z7IfCPcXrfMJw%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Language Understanding (LUIS)</a></u>&nbsp;Services are now generally available in US Government regions.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/details/cognitive-services/content-moderator/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pricing page</a> for details&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/cognitive-services/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "New regions are now available for Azure Cognitive Services. The Content Moderator , Computer Vision , Face , Translator Text , and Language Understanding (LUIS) Services are now generally available in US Government regions.\n\nSee the pricing page for details\n\nLearn more"
  },
